{"id":"chatcmpl-946d9565-e004-409d-8840-a0aed0d980be","object":"chat.completion","created":1795229915,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"When a visual question asks to distinguish left vs. right findings on a lateral radiograph, laterality is often ambiguous from anatomy alone, so explicit image markers and expert-tool confirmation become the decisive evidence. The successful strategy combined orientation analysis, domain-specific sign interpretation, and a targeted expert query before committing to an answer.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a question's options differ only by laterality (left vs. right), prioritize explicit image markers and targeted expert queries over pure anatomical inference.\",\n    \"For lateral-view images, first establish orientation (anterior/posterior, marker placement) before interpreting pathology, since standard conventions can vary.\",\n    \"Use domain-specific sign knowledge (e.g., costophrenic angle blunting, dependent opacity) to confirm the presence of a finding before resolving its side.\",\n    \"When single-view ambiguity is high, delegate a focused yes/no-plus-side question to a specialized expert tool rather than guessing from silhouette alone.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging QA\": \"Check for side markers and standard orientation cues first; interpret pathology using modality-specific signs; confirm ambiguous laterality with a focused expert query.\",\n    \"Visual multiple-choice with near-duplicate options\": \"Identify the single differing attribute (side, location, severity); gather direct evidence for that attribute rather than re-analyzing the whole image.\",\n    \"Tool-assisted reasoning\": \"Route narrowly scoped sub-questions (e.g., 'which side?') to specialized tools, then integrate their output with your own orientation analysis.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm image orientation and any laterality markers before interpreting the finding.\",\n    \"Verify the finding's presence via modality-specific signs, then confirm the side with an expert query before selecting the option.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1107,"total_tokens":1482,"completion_tokens":375,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":1107},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":375}}}